Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:06.80,AmharicTop,,0,0,0,,ቤታችን ለእኛ የመኖሪያ ቦታ ብቻ አይደለም። የፍቅራችን፣ የትዝታችንና የአንድነታችን መገኛ ነው።
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:06.80,EnglishBottom,,0,0,0,,Our home is more than a place to live. It is where our love, memories, and unity belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.35,0:00:14.80,AmharicTop,,0,0,0,,በደስታም ሆነ በፈተና ጊዜ አብረን እንቆማለን። እናቶቻችን በጥበብ ቤታችንን ያቆማሉ።
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.35,0:00:14.80,EnglishBottom,,0,0,0,,In times of joy and struggle, we stand united. Our mothers sustain our home with wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.35,0:00:22.80,AmharicTop,,0,0,0,,ምንም ያህል ርቀን ብንሄድም፣ የቤተሰብ ፍቅር ሁልጊዜ ወደ ቤታችን ይመልሰናል።
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.35,0:00:22.80,EnglishBottom,,0,0,0,,No matter how far we travel, family love always brings us back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.35,0:00:31.80,AmharicTop,,0,0,0,,አብረን እንዘጋጃለን፣ አብረን እንበላለን፣ እንሳቃለን፣ እንመካከራለን።
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.35,0:00:31.80,EnglishBottom,,0,0,0,,We prepare together, eat together, laugh together, and share our counsel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.35,0:00:42.80,AmharicTop,,0,0,0,,በአንድ መሶብ ዙሪያ ምግብ ብቻ ሳይሆን፣ ፍቅርን፣ ክብርንና የትውልድ አንድነትን እንካፈላለን።
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.35,0:00:42.80,EnglishBottom,,0,0,0,,Around one mesob, we share more than food. We share love, respect, and generational unity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.35,0:00:50.80,AmharicTop,,0,0,0,,አንዳንድ ጊዜ ፍቅር የሚገለጸው በታላላቅ ቃላት ሳይሆን፣ በእንዲህ ባሉ ትናንሽ እንክብካቤዎች ነው።
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.35,0:00:50.80,EnglishBottom,,0,0,0,,Sometimes love is expressed not through grand words, but through these quiet, tender gestures.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.35,0:01:01.80,AmharicTop,,0,0,0,,የቡናው መዓዛና ጭስ ሰብስቦን፣ የልብ ጨዋታና የእንግዳ ተቀባይነት ወጋችን ይፈሳል።
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.35,0:01:01.80,EnglishBottom,,0,0,0,,The aroma and smoke of coffee gather us, making room for true hospitality and heartfelt conversations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.35,0:01:11.80,AmharicTop,,0,0,0,,የአባቶቻችን ባህል፣ የእናቶቻችን ምክርና የቤተሰባችን ፍቅር ከትውልድ ወደ ትውልድ ይተላለፋል።
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.35,0:01:11.80,EnglishBottom,,0,0,0,,The traditions of our ancestors, the counsel of our mothers, and our family love pass from generation to generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.35,0:01:22.80,AmharicTop,,0,0,0,,ምክንያቱም ቤተሰብ ማለት አብሮ መኖር ብቻ ሳይሆን፣ አብሮ መኖርን ትርጉም የሚሰጥ ፍቅር ነው።
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.35,0:01:22.80,EnglishBottom,,0,0,0,,Because family is not simply living together; it is the love that gives meaning to being together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.20,0:01:29.80,EndCardTitle,,0,0,0,,የቤታችን ትውስታ\NThe Memories of Our Home
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.20,0:01:29.80,EndCardTagline,,0,0,0,,ባህላችን በእኛ ውስጥ ይኖራል። | Our traditions live through us.
